{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5973","title":"Xiaomi Expands its AIoT Portfolio Spanning Mobility, Wearables, and Everyday Essentials","desc":"Xiaomi today announced its latest ecosystem lineup, featuring Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series, Xiaomi Watch 5, Xiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W, Xiaomi Tag, and REDMI Buds 8 Pro, bringing together intelligent performance, refined design, and","view_cnt":"5433","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1772275612","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/761_operatorx_operatorx_opx/28/02/2026/dc3201811a74ebfee2f3b79726291d5f.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e[Barcelona, Spain, February 28, 2026]\u003c/strong\u003e – Xiaomi today announced its latest ecosystem lineup, featuring Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series, Xiaomi Watch 5, Xiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W, Xiaomi Tag, and REDMI Buds 8 Pro, bringing together intelligent performance, refined design, and seamless connectivity for daily life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series, Built for EverydayRiding\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned to meet diverse riding needs and lifestyles, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series offers a comprehensive lineup spanning high-performance, portable, and entry-level models. The series includes Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Max, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Pro, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6, and Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Lite, each engineered to deliver a smooth, comfortable ride while combining everyday practicality with reliable safety, making urban mobility effortless and enjoyable for riders of all levels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/100_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/a43894974766ef347b858d1bb104bf42.jpg\" alt=\"Five electric scooters displayed side by side, in colors including black, gray, and yellow, featuring different designs and tires. The background is a dark gradient, highlighting the appearance and details of the scooters.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLeading the series, the flagship Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra sets a new benchmark for high-performance commuting. Powered by a 1200W peak power¹ with Boost mode², it delivers confident acceleration and hill-climbing ability on bridges, ramps, and inclines. Large 12-inch all-terrain tires and a dual-swing-arm suspension provide stability and comfort across varied surfaces, while a maximum range of up to 75km and fast charging that restores up to 30km in one hour support extended daily rides with minimal downtime.³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for confident everyday riding, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra features front and rear disc brakes, E-Brake, E-ABS, TCS, and IPX6 water resistance,⁴ while intelligent connectivity via the Xiaomi Home app and Apple Find My⁵ integration adds convenience and peace of mind. Rider comfort and usability are enhanced by ergonomic curved handlebars, a widened deck, a dual-mode thumb \u0026amp; twist throttle, a physical four-direction control button, and a 3-inch color TFT display, all wrapped in a distinctive Lightning Yellow finish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/428_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/40539610f510071c2cf0d8361e380349.jpg\" alt=\"A yellow electric scooter with a modern design, featuring thick tires and a sturdy handlebar. The overall shape is simple, making it suitable for urban commuting.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Watch 5: Flagship Experience Powered with Wear OS by Google™\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowered with the latest version of Wear OS by Google (Wear OS 6), Xiaomi Watch 5 delivers a flagship smartwatch experience, combining intuitive interaction with seamless access to Google services. Optimized Google apps, including Google Calendar, Play, and Maps, enable efficient wrist-based use, while Google Wallet with NFC supports fast, convenient contactless payments. As the first Xiaomi smartwatch to feature Google Gemini out of the box, Xiaomi Watch 5 enables natural, hands-free assistance for everyday tasks, information, and navigation — all without reaching for a phone.⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/15_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/70e5da9e4c90403c436ab66f1525dd52.jpg\" alt=\"Two smartwatches are displayed side by side, with the left side featuring a black strap and the right side featuring a green strap. The watch faces show different color gradients and the time.\"\u003eInteraction is enhanced by advanced quick gestures powered by EMG, IMU, and PPG sensors⁷, allowing essential actions to be completed with simple hand or wrist movements. Through 2 general gestures (Pinch Twice and Rub Twice) and 3 customized gestures (Snap Fingers, Shake Wrist, and Rotate Wrist), users can dismiss calls, silence alarms, launch workouts, remotly control camera for photos and recordings,⁸ or access compatible Google apps such as Google Gemini, Google Wallet, and YouTube Music,⁶ delivering a more fluid and hands-free experience throughout the day. Seamless cross-device control is further enabled by Xiaomi HyperConnect, such as remote accessing the phone camera for photo and recordings,⁸ and connected-device management via Xiaomi Smart Hub.⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/451_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/fa47be9aa3dd78d9cb881c46c84a7f31.jpg\" alt=\"A smartwatch with a black strap is worn on a wrist, the dial displays a red background and simple hands, with fingers slightly extended. The background is pure white.\"\u003eBuilt to support extended daily use, Xiaomi Watch 5 features a 930mAh battery with 10% Silicon-Carbon content¹⁰ enhanced by Xiaomi Surge Battery technology and a dual-chip architecture powered by Snapdragon® W5 Gen 1 and BES2800 low-power co-processor, delivering up to 6 days of battery life in smart mode or up to 18 days in power saver mode.¹⁰ Encased in a stainless-steel frame, Xiaomi Watch 5 features a 1.54-inch ultra-large display with an ultra-thin bezel, protected by sapphire glass on both the front and back for long-term durability.¹⁰ Comprehensive health and fitness tracking includes one-tap health checks,¹¹ advanced training insights, and precise outdoor tracking with dual-band GNSS for offline maps.¹² Designed to balance performance, intelligence, and premium craftsmanship, Xiaomi Watch 5 delivers a fully connected smartwatch experience built for modern lifestyles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W: Ultra-Slim Power for Life on the Move\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W redefines portable charging with an ultra-slim, lightweight design built for everyday mobility. Measuring just 6mm thin and weighing 98g,¹³ its compact, card-sized form fits easily into pockets or small bags, making it a convenient companion for commuting, travel, and extended days on the go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/507_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/b86b707785afad88cfbab53faa0fbae2.jpg\"\u003eDesigned for modern lifestyles, the power bank supports fast charging via wireless and wired methods, and offers simultaneous wired and wireless output. With up to 15W wireless fast charging¹⁴ and high-speed USB-C wired charging,¹⁵ it delivers efficient power when time is limited, while magnetic alignment ensures stable charging and comfortable one-handed use. Despite its minimal profile, Xiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W features a high-density 5000mAh battery with 16% silicon-carbon content,¹⁰ supported by advanced thermal management and multiple safety protections for reliable, stable performance. Finished in a refined aluminum alloy body with sleek color options, it balances portability, performance, and durability—making dependable power effortless to carry wherever the day leads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Tag: Seamless Tracking for Everyday Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Tag delivers a simple, reliable tracking experience that integrates seamlessly into daily life. Compatible with either Apple Find My or Google Android Find Hub, Xiaomi Tag works within the user's chosen iOS or Android ecosystem,¹⁶ enabling easy location tracking of everyday items such as keys, bags, or luggage through familiar platforms.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/312_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/3e62cb440ec92d75e959b16f73a8c1a6.jpg\" alt=\"This is a white wireless charger with a silver metal frame on the edges. The surface is smooth and has a modern and minimalist appearance. The charger is placed on a white background.\"\u003eEquipped with intelligent tracking capabilities, Xiaomi Tag supports remote item finding,¹⁷ lost mode, collaborative finding, and enhanced privacy protection. When connected to a smartphone and within Bluetooth range, users can locate Xiaomi Tag easily and trigger a sound through Apple Find My app or Google Android Find Hub¹⁷ Lost mode allows users to mark an item as missing and add contact information to facilitate recovery, while collaborative finding further enhances retrieval by enabling secure location sharing within the network when needed. To better protect user privacy and prevent unwanted tracking, the phone automatically alerts users when an unknown tracking tag is detected moving with them.²⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for everyday use, Xiaomi Tag features a compact and lightweight form with a metal outer ring and a minimalist body. Weighing approximately 10g,¹⁰ it attaches easily to keys, backpacks, or luggage without adding bulk, while the built-in hanging and labeling design ensures it is ready to use straight out of the box. Built for real-world reliability, Xiaomi Tag offers up to over one year of battery life¹⁸ with a replaceable CR2032 battery and IP67 dust and water resistance.¹⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Buds 8 Pro: Immersive Sound with Intelligent Noise Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eEngineered to deliver rich, detailed sound and immersive listening in everyday scenarios, REDMI Buds 8 Pro features an upgraded coaxial triple-driver configuration that delivers deeper bass, clearer vocals, and balanced audio across frequencies. With support for Dolby Audio,²⁰ REDMI Buds 8 Pro can add dimensionality and clarity to your audio experience for entertainment like movies, videos, and games, and deliver dialogue with crisp clarity, making it more vivid and true to life. The surround sound performance is further enhanced by an independent sound processing unit integrated into each earbud, ensuring consistent audio quality across different smartphone brands and applications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/671_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/215ee92cf790308726fcab978e2720b5.jpg\" alt=\"A set of wireless earbuds, including a gray and black charging case, with the earbuds placed in the gray box, featuring a simple and modern overall design.\"\u003eIn addition, REDMI Buds 8 Pro features Xiaomi dimensional audio,²¹ offering multiple dedicated spatial audio modes tailored to different listening scenarios — including Standard mode for balanced everyday use, Music mode for enhanced vocals and bass, Video mode for a more cinematic soundstage, Game mode for precise spatial cues, and Audiobooks mode for clearer, more focused voice playback.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned to maintain focus in complex environments, REDMI Buds 8 Pro supports up to 55dB active noise cancellation with an extended bandwidth of up to 5kHz,²² reducing both low-frequency rumbles and higher-pitched ambient noise effectively. An advanced adaptive noise-reduction algorithm samples environmental sound up to 32,000 times per second,¹⁰ enabling real-time adjustment for smoother, more consistent quietness. For calls, the triple-microphone AI noise-reduction system effectively minimizes ambient noise, ensuring reliable communication indoors and outdoors. A dedicated wind-noise-resistant design further enhances call clarity, providing clear voice pickup even in winds up to 12 m/s.²³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for everyday convenience, REDMI Buds 8 Pro supports fast charging, delivering up to 2 hours of listening from just 5 minutes of charging,²⁴ alongside long-lasting battery performance of up to 8 hours of continuous playback on a single charge, or up to 33 hours with the charging case.²⁵ Intuitive touch controls, dual-device Bluetooth connectivity, and IP54 dust and water resistance²⁶ enhance usability across work, travel, and workouts. Together, REDMI Buds 8 Pro combines immersive sound, intelligent noise control, and practical design to deliver a premium wireless listening experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series, Xiaomi Watch 5, Xiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W, Xiaomi Tag, and REDMI Buds 8 Pro are now available on Xiaomi's official channels and authorized retailers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra: Priced starting at €799.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Max: Priced starting at €649.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Pro: Priced starting at €549.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6: Priced starting at €399.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Lite: Priced starting at €329.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Watch 5: Priced starting at €299.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGlacier Silver and Graphite Black: Priced starting at €59.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRadiant Orange: Priced starting at €64.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Tag:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 Pack: Priced starting at €14.9\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e4 Pack: Priced starting at €49.9\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Buds 8 Pro: Priced starting at €69.9\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease visit \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003emi.com/global\u003c/a\u003e for more detailed information on these products and their features.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images are available here:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgDILRm4fdn3Rop9PgaLDVOrAXoabFzlxYGEkSnwxAbhQkA?e=pPkpGf\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgD-1Wk813EuR5-_1f7EvSIYAbkn2wjhfC2tyHgxG8fZmnI?e=gFCtX0\"\u003eXiaomi Watch 5\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgA8-DUMYSllRKRcdmH5ZPKMAUelSD2FUjWkcicqriVgoto?e=9wSwsn\"\u003eXiaomi UltraThin Magnetic Power Bank 5000 15W\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgDuKKe5RhEhRId4W7nCu-atAU9-exgFl3anxiii-s6DMLg?e=f5GcKX\"\u003eXiaomi Tag\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgDvspVHEBFJSKGfTrbJ9wQjAdcnrvczO_wXPiNUBbDEONk?e=IevRn6\"\u003eREDMI Buds 8 Pro\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Series Quick Specs²⁷\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/237_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/1e9aeb7f3c073d8e3f50eaa0cdcd989f.jpg\" alt=\"This table compares various models of Xiaomi electric scooters, highlighting differences in performance, design, battery, and safety features. Here’s a summary of the key points:\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n- **Power**: Ranges from 300W/500W (Lite) to 500W/1200W (Ultra).\r\n- **Incline Capability**: Varies from 15% (Lite) to 25% (Ultra).\r\n- **Brakes**: Different combinations of disc and drum brakes with E-Brake across models.\r\n- **Tires**: Sizes and types vary, with some models featuring tubeless and pneumatic tires.\r\n- **Suspension**: Ranges from dual-swing-arm to single-spring systems.\r\n  \r\n### Design\r\n- **Display**: Most models have a 3” TFT display, while the Lite has a digital display.\r\n- **Throttle**: Most models use a 2-in-1 throttle; Lite and Pro use finger throttles.\r\n- **Max Load**: Max load ranges from 100kg (Lite) to 140kg (Ultra).\r\n\r\n### Battery\r\n- **Range**: Varies from 25km (Lite) to 75km (Ultra) at a speed of 15km/h.\r\n- **Fast Charging**: Only available in the Max and Ultra models.\r\n\r\n### Intelligence \u0026amp; Safety\r\n- **Bluetooth Searching**: Available in all models.\r\n- **Apple Find My**: Supported in Ultra and Max models only.\r\n- **Battery Management System (BMS)**: Present in all models except Lite.\r\n- **TCS (Traction Control System)**: Supported in Ultra, Max, and Pro models.\r\n\r\nThis summary provides an overview of the features and specifications of the Xiaomi electric scooters, making it easier to compare them based on individual needs.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Powerful 1200W motor: Motor output was tested using a dynamometer at a maximum voltage of 54.6Vdc and peak cut-off current. Compliance requirement: ≥1200W. Tested by Beijing TIRT Technology Service Co., Ltd. Report No.: OTSA1-202501024/OTSA1-202501025/OTSA1-202501023/OTSA1-202501038.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Boost mode can only be activated via the vehicle's button (simultaneously long-press the M key + right brake) after starting it on the app, and the vehicle needs to be in S gear, with a speed of 0km/h, battery level above 40%, and normal vehicle temperature.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ 75km or 47 miles long travel range: Tested in windless conditions at 25 ± 2°C. A fully-charged scooter was driven at a constant 15km/h or 9mph on a test bench until shutdown, with a 75 ± 0.5kg load. Tested by Beijing TIRT Technology Service Co., Ltd. Report No.: OTSA1-202501024/OTSA1-202501025/OTSA1-202501023/OTSA1-202501038. 30km or 19 miles is the average range achieved after 1 hour of fast charging. A compatible fast charger needs to be purchased separately for quick charging. Data tested by the manufacturer. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ IPX6 overall water resistance: Complies with the IEC 60529:2013 test standard. Testing was conducted by Beijing TIRT Technology Service Co., Ltd. Report No.: OTSA1-202501024/OTSA1-202501025/OTSA1-202501023/OTSA1-202501038.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ The Apple Find My feature is disabled by default and needs to be enabled manually via the Xiaomi Home app or the Find My app. System required: iOS 14.5 and macOS 11.5 or later. Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra is not endorsed, sponsored, or affiliated with Apple Inc. in any way. Apple, iPhone, Apple Watch, Mac, macOS, iPad and iPadOS are registered trademarks of Apple Inc.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Check responses. Set up required. Compatibility and availability vary. Google, Wear OS by Google, Gemini, and other marks are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ Ensure Tilt-to-wake and Gestures are enabled on the watch. To activate, remain still with your forearm parallel to your chest and the watch face up. Gesture controls are available only on supported pages when a floating bubble or blue dot icon appears. The feature may not respond in certain scenarios, including but not limited to Sleep mode, Do Not Disturb mode, Always-On Display (AOD) watch face, or when sleep is detected. Specific usage scenarios are subject to the actual user experience and the details outlined in the watch's gesture instructions. To use gesture features, please update the watch system to the latest version.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ To use this function, a phone running Xiaomi HyperOS 3 is required, and the watch system needs to be updated to the latest version. Both devices must maintain a stable Bluetooth connection during use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ To use the Xiaomi Smart Hub, the watch needs to be connected to a Xiaomi smartphone or pad supporting the latest version of Xiaomi HyperOS 3 and running the latest version of the Mi Fitness app and version 10.4 or above of the Xiaomi Home app. Xiaomi Smart Hub must be enabled on the smartphone or tablet in advance.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary. Please visit Xiaomi's official website for more details.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ This product and its features are not designed to be a medical device, and are not intended to predict, diagnose, prevent, or cure any disease.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Feature availability may vary by region. Please check your local official website for more information. Offline maps must be downloaded separately via the Mi Fitness app on your smartphone.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ Measurements and weight may vary slightly depending on the manufacturing process.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ 15W wireless fast charging is supported on the Xiaomi 17 Series. Actual performance may vary due to environmental conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ Wired fast charging requires a 3A Xiaomi USB-C cable or higher.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ Xiaomi Tag is not endorsed by, sponsored by, or affiliated with Google LLC or Apple Inc. in any way. Google and Find Hub are trademarks of Google LLC. Apple and Find My are trademarks of Apple Inc. Xiaomi Tag supports phones and tablets running Android 9 or later via Google Find Hub, or supports iPhone and iPad running iOS 14.5 or iPadOS 14.5 or later via Apple Find My. Google Find Hub and Apple Find My are not supported simultaneously.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷ When the Xiaomi Tag is within the Bluetooth range of a signed-in iOS device or an Android device with Google Android Find Hub, the Find My app or Google Android Find Hub app can locate the Xiaomi Tag and trigger it to play a sound.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸ Battery life data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary depending on firmware updates, usage conditions, and environmental factors. Battery life is measured under the following daily usage conditions: four sound searches per day. Battery life may vary based on usage, environmental conditions, replacement battery manufacturer, and other factors; actual results may differ.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹ The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions, not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage, and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see Xiaomi's official website.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁰ Dolby, Dolby Audio™, and the double-D symbol are registered trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹ Dolby surround sound and Xiaomi dimensional audio are mutually exclusive and cannot be enabled simultaneously.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²² Active noise cancellation test data provided by the National Institute of Metrology, China. The product achieves 55dB ANC depth within a particular frequency range and 5kHz at a specific depth range, but not simultaneously. Tests are conducted separately. Actual results may vary with usage.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²³ Wind noise cancellation test data provided by the National Institute of Metrology, China. Actual results may vary with usage.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁴ When the charging case has at least 20% battery remaining, a 5-minute fast charge provides up to 2 hours of playback. Test conditions: Using AAC, ANC disabled, at 50% volume, with all other functions at default settings. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs, based on simulations of real-life scenarios. Actual results may vary depending on firmware updates, usage conditions, charging level, and environmental factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁵ 8 hours and 33 hours of earbud battery life refer to music playback time. Test conditions: Fully charged, Bluetooth AAC connection, ANC and dual-device connection disabled, at 50% volume, with all other functions set to default. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs, based on simulations of real-life scenarios. Actual results may vary depending on firmware updates, usage conditions, charging level, and environmental factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁶ IP54 rating only applies to the earbuds. Testing was conducted by TÜV SÜD Certification and Testing (China) Co., Ltd. Shanghai Branch (Report No. 704202506085-00). The earbuds are not resistant to hot water and are not suitable for wearing while bathing or showering. It is recommended to avoid intense exercise to prevent damage caused by sweat infiltration. Splash, water, and dust resistance are not permanent and may degrade over time.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁷ For more information, please see Xiaomi's official website.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁸ Anti-tracking support varies by Find network. Please refer to the official Apple Find My and Google Find Hub websites for detailed support information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2025, the MAU reached approximately 741.7 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 1,035.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"702","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1772289031"},"common":null}